---
layout: base.njk
title: Parent Survey - High Adventure
description: Parents, share your feedback on the Troop 69 High Adventure program.
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Parent & Guardian Survey</h1>
  <p class="lead">Help us plan the best High Adventure experience for our scouts. Your input matters!</p>
</section>

<section class="overview">
  <h2>Share Your Thoughts</h2>

  <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xgolzpkn" method="POST" class="survey-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="/survey/thanks">
    <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Parent High Adventure Survey Response">
    <input type="hidden" name="survey_type" value="parent">

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="parent_name">Your Name *</label>
      <input type="text" id="parent_name" name="parent_name" required>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="scout_name">Scout(s) Name(s) *</label>
      <input type="text" id="scout_name" name="scout_name" placeholder="Name of your scout(s) in Troop 69" required>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>🚗 Trip Transportation</h3>
    
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Are you interested in helping with transportation to/from trips? *</label>
      <select id="transportation" name="transportation" required>
        <option value="">Select option...</option>
        <option value="Yes - I can drive">Yes - I can drive</option>
        <option value="Yes - I can help coordinate">Yes - I can help coordinate logistics</option>
        <option value="Maybe - depends on timing">Maybe - depends on timing/destination</option>
        <option value="No - unable to help">No - unable to help</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>👨‍👩‍👧 Chaperone & Volunteer Interest</h3>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Would you be interested in serving as a chaperone on High Adventure trips? *</label>
      <select id="chaperone" name="chaperone" required>
        <option value="">Select option...</option>
        <option value="Yes - definitely">Yes - definitely interested</option>
        <option value="Yes - maybe">Yes - maybe, depends on trip dates</option>
        <option value="Interested but cannot commit">Interested but cannot commit right now</option>
        <option value="No - unable to attend">No - unable to attend</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Would you be interested in helping with trip planning/fundraising? *</label>
      <select id="planning_help" name="planning_help" required>
        <option value="">Select option...</option>
        <option value="Yes - trip planning">Yes - I'd like to help plan trips</option>
        <option value="Yes - fundraising">Yes - I'd like to help with fundraising</option>
        <option value="Yes - both">Yes - both!</option>
        <option value="Maybe">Maybe - tell me more</option>
        <option value="No">No</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="volunteer_skills">Do you have any skills that could help? (Check all that apply)</label>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="First Aid/CPR"> First Aid/CPR Certified</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="Cooking"> Cooking/Meal Planning</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="Budgeting"> Budgeting/Financial Planning</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="Logistics"> Trip Logistics/Planning</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="Photography"> Photography/Media</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="Driving"> Van/Transportation</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="Outdoor Skills"> Outdoor Skills/Leadership</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="skills" value="None"> None of the above</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>💰 Cost Considerations</h3>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>How big a factor is cost in deciding whether your scout can do a trip? *</label>
      <select id="cost_factor" name="cost_factor" required>
        <option value="">Select...</option>
        <option value="Major factor">Major factor - cost determines whether we can go</option>
        <option value="Significant factor">Significant factor - cost heavily influences our decision</option>
        <option value="Moderate factor">Moderate factor - we consider cost but it's not the main driver</option>
        <option value="Minor factor">Minor factor - cost is not a major concern</option>
        <option value="Not a factor">Not a factor at all - we'll go regardless of cost</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Would fundraisers help make trips more affordable for your family? *</label>
      <select id="fundraising_interest" name="fundraising_interest" required>
        <option value="">Select...</option>
        <option value="Yes - we would participate">Yes - we would actively participate</option>
        <option value="Maybe - depends on effort">Maybe - depends on how much effort required</option>
        <option value="No - we'd rather pay directly">No - we'd rather pay directly</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>📝 Additional Feedback</h3>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="comments">Any other comments, questions, or concerns?</label>
      <textarea id="comments" name="comments" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us anything else we should know..."></textarea>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Survey</button>
  </form>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <h2>Thank You!</h2>
  <p>Your feedback helps us plan trips that work for everyone. We'll be in touch!</p>
  <p><a href="/survey">Click here to take the Scout Survey →</a></p>
</section>

